{"name":"Never Forget","hex":"#a67283","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"never","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adverb","definitions":["At no time; on no occasion; in no circumstance.","Not at any other time; not on any other occasion; not previously."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["Did not; didn't."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/never"},{"term":"forget","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To lose remembrance of.","To unintentionally not do, neglect."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/forget"}],"entries":[{"title":"Never Forget (Take That song)","blocks":[{"text":"\"Never Forget\" is a song recorded by English boy band Take That, included as the sixth track on their third studio album, Nobody Else (1995). Written by Gary Barlow and produced by Brothers in Rhythm and Dave James, it features Howard Donald on lead vocals."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/5/5f/Take_that_never_forget_CD1.jpg/330px-Take_that_never_forget_CD1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Never_Forget_(Take_That_song)","wikidata":"Q3875124"},{"title":"Never Forget (musical)","blocks":[{"text":"Never Forget is a jukebox musical with a book written by Guy Jones and Ed Curtis, with screenwriter Danny Brocklehurst acting as story advisor, based on the 1990s songs of boy band Take That, written by Gary Barlow. In addition to Barlow's songs, Never Forget features additional music and lyrics by Barry Manilow, Dan Hartman and Adrienne Anderson, all of which were covered by Take That in the 1990s. The musical's story focuses on the themes of friendship, ambition, love and betrayal among the members of a Take That tribute band, but it is not related to the history of Take That. The musical is named after Take That's chart-topping single \"Never Forget\"."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/d/dd/NFPosterS.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Never_Forget_(musical)","wikidata":"Q16955896"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/b/b7/Take_that_never_forget_CD2.jpg/330px-Take_that_never_forget_CD2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/b/b7/Take_that_never_forget_CD2.jpg/330px-Take_that_never_forget_CD2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ATake_that_never_forget_CD2.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/6/6a/Take_that_never_forget_promo_cd_single.jpg/330px-Take_that_never_forget_promo_cd_single.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/6/6a/Take_that_never_forget_promo_cd_single.jpg/330px-Take_that_never_forget_promo_cd_single.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ATake_that_never_forget_promo_cd_single.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/2/24/Tube_Station_Show_Poster.jpg/330px-Tube_Station_Show_Poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/2/24/Tube_Station_Show_Poster.jpg/330px-Tube_Station_Show_Poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Poster – Warren Street Underground Station","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ATube_Station_Show_Poster.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/5/58/NFTheMusical.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 1x","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/5/58/NFTheMusical.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content